ection-radio-show-165-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #165 w/ Lakim, Andres, Sunni Colòn, & J-Louis","artwork":"/images/episodes/165.jpg","content":"Soulection 3 Year pre-party Celebration!\n<!--more-->\n\nWe had a packed house at Kbeach with plenty of good vibes flowing. In fact it was Joe's first time meeting Lakim in person after all these years. This is Lakim's first time out in L.A. so we wanted to make sure Lakim was welcomed properly. We had him drop a quick preview set on the radio show and talk about his forthcoming album \"This Is Her\" a little. We also had Andres drop a quick set to switch up the vibes, After Andres, we had Sunni Colòn & J-Louis both come on and preview some remixes that we've been putting together. So much talent in one room. Big ups to Marvel Alexander and shouts to everyone who came out to our 3 year Anniversary party. It was massive and hectic at the same time. Stay tuned for our announcement to our new Soulection monthly.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10806,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-02-15T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"tbF5hASfxOA","position":27,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Ty Dolla $ign - Work (feat. Casey Veggies, Twista & Nate Poetics)","track":{"id":"CSGszbAfY9k","path":"/artists/ty-dolla-ign/tracks/work-feat-casey-veggies-twista-nate-poetics/","slug":"work-feat-casey-veggies-twista-and-nate-poetics","title":"Work (feat. Casey Veggies, Twista & Nate Poetics)","artist":{"slug":"ty-dolla-ign","title":"Ty Dolla $ign"},"artwork":"images/artists/ty-dolla-ign/tracks/work-feat-casey-veggies-twista-nate-poetics.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"iiHdl1Frjo4","slug":"166","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-166-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #166 w/ Esta & The Whooligan","artwork":"/images/ep